WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.770
Ever since Inside Out came out, Pixar fans
have been trying to find where all the times

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:08.620
the Pizza Planet Truck appears in the movie.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:13.800
Director Pete Docter said this particular
Pixar easter egg regular pops up 3 times,

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:19.480
but he also said it's so hard to see that
he challenged us Pixar fans to find it!

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:24.050
There was a tweet that suggested it appeared
in the background of San Francisco and Chinatown.

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:28.450
Now, I've scoured those scenes and could only
find a few trucks that looked similar to the

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.439
Pizza Planet truck but they didn't clearly
have the rocket on the roof.

00:00:32.439 --> 00:00:36.530
So, I decided to take a look at some of the
scenes in the memory again, and I've found

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:40.280
not just three, but four appearances in three
scenes!

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.989
Let's take a look at where they crop up!

00:00:41.989 --> 00:00:46.460
The first time the truck makes an appearance
is around 37 minutes into the movie, when

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:51.710
Joy spots Riley's imaginary friend Bing Bong
for the first time and, as he runs away, a

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:55.549
memory ball featuring the Pizza Planet Truck
falls to the floor and rolls along.

00:00:55.549 --> 00:00:59.800
By the way, Pixar have confirmed this is definitely
the truck!

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:04.199
We see the truck for a second time about 45
minutes into the movie.

00:01:04.199 --> 00:01:07.250
This time it appears during Riley's ice hockey
game.

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:12.360
In this scene, we actually see the truck twice;
first up we see it in a memory ball when Riley

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:17.479
begins to play hockey; and we see it again
in a memory ball after Riley falls down while

00:01:17.479 --> 00:01:20.869
taking a shot and Anger starts to explode.

00:01:20.869 --> 00:01:24.689
The last time we see the truck is in a memory
ball on the Train of Thought.

00:01:24.689 --> 00:01:28.500
Joy, Sadness, and Bing Bong are trying to
make their way back to Headquarters on the

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:33.700
Train, and while Joy and Sadness are talking,
Bing Bong is examining memory balls in a box,

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:37.490
and for a moment he even picks up the one
with the Pizza Planet Truck in it .

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:42.200
Oh, by the way, I didn't mention this one
earlier as I'm not a 100% sure about it, so

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:46.740
let me know what you think, but could this
be another appearance of the truck in the

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.829
scene where Joy runs after Bing Bong?

00:01:48.829 --> 00:01:50.930
Or is it just Riley's family car?

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:52.020
What do you see?!

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:56.770
So, guys, did you send yourselves cross-eyed
trying to find the Pizza Planet Truck in Inside

00:01:56.770 --> 00:01:57.770
Out?

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:01.219
And who's your favourite character in any
Pixar movie?

